        "y0": 0.7014318781377306,
        "x1": 0.4195546496206772,
        "y1": 0.7166654651503761
      },
      "text": "conter, foi de Jurassien. Sous les airs bonhommes",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.47567603054849605,
        "y0": 0.69485250376906,
        "x1": 0.6067970007181597,
        "y1": 0.7100860907817055
      },
      "text": "il y a un chemin ».",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05045046957213084,
        "y0": 0.7197121727657013,
        "x1": 0.4181760283045265,
        "y1": 0.7349457597783469
      },
      "text": "de Clément Pernot, on devine un tempérament de",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4648652010916247,
        "y0": 0.7162096506001432,
        "x1": 0.6589580023990399,
        "y1": 0.7354520763003269
      },
      "text": "- Un sport de prédilection ?",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05045046957213084,
        "y0": 0.737992467393672,
        "x1": 0.4185419827218593,
        "y1": 0.7532260544063175
      },
      "text": "lutteur, pas expansif mais obstiné – un caractère de",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.47567605964561116,
        "y0": 0.7407714949843289,
        "x1": 0.5780347933563664,
        "y1": 0.7560050819969744
      },
      "text": "Œil pétillant…",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5772503933259572,
        "y0": 0.7407714949843289,
        "x1": 0.9445393789425334,
        "y1": 0.7560050819969744
      },
      "text": "« J’ai une passion pour le sport, le vélo en particulier",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05045046957213084,
        "y0": 0.7562727620216428,
        "x1": 0.409795768168086,
        "y1": 0.7715063490342883
      },
      "text": "laboureur, de semeur, de moissonneur-faucheur…",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.47567605964561116,
        "y0": 0.7590517896122997,
        "x1": 0.9402913165180351,
        "y1": 0.7742853766249451
      },
      "text": "et je suis vraiment heureux que le Jura accueille le Tour de France ;",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05045046957213084,
        "y0": 0.7768228804931613,
        "x1": 0.41858912004841403,
        "y1": 0.7920564675058068
      },
      "text": "Fier d’être Jurassien, le Président est un homme",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.47567605964561116,
        "y0": 0.7773320842402704,
        "x1": 0.9446681045799891,
        "y1": 0.7925656712529159
      },
      "text": "j’entretiens des relations amicales avec les organisateurs. Bref,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05045046957213084,
        "y0": 0.7951031873551369,
        "x1": 0.4201162530403273,
        "y1": 0.8103367743677823
      },
      "text": "d’ouverture : « J’aime découvrir ce qu’il se passe",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.47567605964561116,
        "y0": 0.7956123911022459,
        "x1": 0.9457767046674804,
        "y1": 0.8108459781148915
      },
      "text": "j’apprécie le milieu cycliste ! Je vais aussi aux matchs de foot et",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05045046957213084,
        "y0": 0.8133834942171123,
        "x1": 0.41872311226371317,
        "y1": 0.8286170812297579
      },
      "text": "ailleurs, je suis souvent surpris par les initiatives",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4756760887427263,
        "y0": 0.8148524067034874,
        "x1": 0.9354906998767005,
        "y1": 0.8300859937161328
      },
      "text": "de rugby, j’aime ces ambiances et l’action sportive en général. »",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05045046957213084,
        "y0": 0.8316638010790879,
        "x1": 0.23311040329484298,
        "y1": 0.8468973880917334
      },
      "text": "d’autres départements. »",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4648652010916247,
        "y0": 0.8362097492786471,
        "x1": 0.6767608977253143,
        "y1": 0.8554521749788309
      },
      "text": "- Des lectures en particulier ?",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05045046957213084,
        "y0": 0.8522139073166016,
        "x1": 0.41842242267567814,
        "y1": 0.8674474943292472
      },
      "text": "Président tout terrain, attaché aux terroirs, Clément",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.47567605964561116,
        "y0": 0.8607715936628328,
        "x1": 0.5983116418017711,
        "y1": 0.8760051806754783
      },
      "text": "Soupir explicite…",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5974493196969708,
        "y0": 0.8607715936628328,
        "x1": 0.944492299810209,
        "y1": 0.8760051806754783
      },
      "text": "« J’aime lire et je regrette de ne pas avoir assez de",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05045046957213084,
        "y0": 0.8704942141785772,
        "x1": 0.41868324921594774,
        "y1": 0.8857278011912226
      },
      "text": "Pernot tient aux valeurs humanistes et donc aux",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.47567603054849605,
        "y0": 0.8790519005248083,
        "x1": 0.9444941038313487,
        "y1": 0.8942854875374538
      },
      "text": "temps. Je lis tout de même la presse et j’apprécie particulièrement",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05045046957213084,
        "y0": 0.8887745210405527,
        "x1": 0.42036992169026827,
        "y1": 0.9040081080531982
      },
      "text": "rencontres tous azimuts dans son Jura natal et",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.47567603054849605,
        "y0": 0.8973322073867839,
        "x1": 0.9444125737146781,
        "y1": 0.9125657943994293
      },
      "text": "les titres de L’Équipe et du Canard enchaîné. Ils sont vraiment forts",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05045046957213084,
        "y0": 0.9070548279025282,
        "x1": 0.14885458526474862,
        "y1": 0.9222884149151738
      },
      "text": "bien au-delà !",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.47567603054849605,
        "y0": 0.9156125142487594,
        "x1": 0.6348399855874959,
        "y1": 0.9308461012614049
      },
      "text": "et pleins d’humour ! »",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    }
